<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador monetary base up 15 pct in wk to April 4.</title>
<headline>Ecuador monetary base up 15 pct in wk to April 4.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's monetary base grew 15 percent to 3.28 billion sucres ($858.4 million) in the week to April 4, the Central Bank said Monday.</p>
<p>In March, the monetary base grew 0.42 percent to 2.85 billion sucres.</p>
<p>The monetary base stood at 3.06 billion sucres at the end of 1996, up from 2.41 billion sucres at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>((-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433</p>
